<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 11.8 points to 810.6 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 11.8 points to 810.6 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 11.8 points on Tuesday to 810.6, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Nine of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the investment fund index losing the most, down 38.6 points, or 3.11 percent, to 1,202.5 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
